674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NFZeivLhgJkQ7kNvwGNIfC-&_nc_oc=AdqXaL0MgkMxbZdqmYhaQNjdfTkrlqQ1LZlp5sD6183hCFtymW4elotrwwDofGwwSks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLt3Y9QB6gHUfe1TbtwttmFRYQ9_6EF_F8yruDOrOQsXg&oe=6A9AD659"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MbUK1BDlAJwQ7kNvwEKNfOD&_nc_oc=AdrgY72aY1cNtqweliQVEufj-E8Am72S477ZtYpScjroO53U7IORLPVV3vLzzH_30OM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLDi2O9gfS7H0G3ekzf8c0oYvtZm7gtiwZ9-30buf6tig&oe=6A9ADF16"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3U2iMxvxLg8Q7kNvwGsfBdZ&_nc_oc=AdoyLFb5a5MrVZq9gsgkoc8xWPgxL5u1U6oaiRxKy3gPcRwCyYS80zJhq1lhjCkhcZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJJMaZzQaMvfGQwf-VK-fncAYDiWEIz4NYFM7C0xDV8dQ&oe=6A9ADB31"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip